---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---

<Base
  title="The Studio"
  description="Milzy Ceramics is a small studio in Southern California making wheel-thrown, faceted, soda fired stoneware."
>
  <PageHead
    eyebrow="The studio"
    title="Made slowly, finished by fire"
  />

  <section class="wrap studio">
    <!-- Replace this panel with a portrait or studio photograph: public/images/studio.jpg -->
    <div class="studio__image" role="img" aria-label="The Milzy Ceramics studio"></div>

    <div class="studio__text prose">
      <p class="lede">
        Milzy Ceramics is a one-person studio in Southern California, devoted to a single way of
        working: wheel-thrown stoneware, often faceted by hand, and finished in the soda kiln.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every piece begins on the wheel. Many are cut into facets while the clay is still soft,
        giving the fire edges to find. Glaze is used sparingly, in places, so that bare clay
        is left for the soda to colour. Then the work goes into the kiln and is fired to cone 10.
      </p>
      <blockquote>&ldquo;Half me, half accident.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <p>
        That is the honest description of every piece here. The form, the cuts and the glaze
        are decisions. The rust, the flashing and the drips are the fire&rsquo;s reply. No piece
        is repeated, and nothing is made in batches to a template.
      </p>
      <p>
        The studio has shared its work through Etsy since 2021, where every review to date has
        been five stars.
      </p>
      <p class="actions">
        <a href="/collection/" class="button button--solid">View the collection</a>
        <a href="/learn/soda-firing/" class="link">How soda firing works</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .studio {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .studio__image {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 60% 70%, rgba(180, 83, 42, 0.6) 0%, transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #2a2522 0%, #161412 100%);
    position: sticky;
    top: 3rem;
  }
  .studio__text .lede {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .studio {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .studio__image {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
